{67}{Stillwater?  Oh, she's just a small town.  Used to be quite a place, back when Bates first made his steam engine...people used to think we'd be as big as Tarant!  But, as you can see, we're still just the same old Stillwater...a few stores, a few people.  All in all a pretty quiet little town...}{Stillwater?  Oh, she's just a small town.  Used to be quite a place, back when Bates first made his steam engine...people used to think we'd be as big as Tarant!  But, as you can see, we're still just the same old Stillwater...a few stores, a few people.  All in all a pretty quiet little town...}{}{}{}{}
{68}{What is there to see around here?}{}{5}{}{72}{}
{69}{K:}{}{5}{}{43}{}
