{72}{Oh, not much.  We've an inn and a tavern, if you're looking for a place to stay.  Other than our well-made weapons [He gestures to some of his wares, smiling.], I suppose our biggest claim to fame is the Stillwater Giant.  Oh...I'd guess that some people find the Cult of Geshtianna a bit strange...}{Oh, not much.  We've an inn and a tavern, if you're looking for a place to stay.  Other than our well-made weapons [He gestures to some of his wares, smiling.], I suppose our biggest claim to fame is the Stillwater Giant.  Oh...I'd guess that some people find the Cult of Geshtianna a bit strange...}{}{}{}{gf2197 1}
