{87}{The Stillwater Giant?  Oh...its just a local legend, really.  Folks have been seeing the monster all over the country for years, but I think its all a load of bunk.  If you're interested in finding out more about it, there's a man named Stanley Hippington here in town who can tell you more about it...}{The Stillwater Giant?  Oh...its just a local legend, really.  Folks have been seeing the monster all over the country for years, but I think its all a load of bunk.  If you're interested in finding out more about it, there's a man named Stanley Hippington here in town who can tell you more about it...}{}{}{}{}
