{93}{The Cult?  Oh, its one of the newer religions that seem to pop up all over the place.  They worship some fertility goddess, have large festivals...generally make a nuisance of themselves.  Heathens, if you ask me.  But, if you have questions about it, you may want to speak with Brigitte...she's a high priestess in the cult...}{The Cult?  Oh, its one of the newer religions that seem to pop up all over the place.  They worship some fertility goddess, have large festivals...generally make a nuisance of themselves.  Heathens, if you ask me.  But, if you have questions about it, you may want to speak with Brigitte...she's a high priestess in the cult...}{}{}{}{}
