{119}{No...there's a local wizard in these parts who I use to enchant the weapons...he's a stubborn old codger, but we get along pretty well.  Goes by the name of Cyrus.  He puts spells on my weapons, and I check in on him from time to time, do seem work around his place when he needs it.  Come to think of it...what day is it...?}{No...there's a local wizard in these parts who I use to enchant the weapons...he's a stubborn old codger, but we get along pretty well.  Goes by the name of Cyrus.  He puts spells on my weapons, and I check in on him from time to time, do seem work around his place when he needs it.  Come to think of it...what day is it...?}{}{}{}{}
